  "intro": {
    "text": "Take `-mak` or `-mek` off the infinitive to get the stem: *yapmak* → *yap-*. Then add `-Iyor` and the endings of **to be**: *yapıyorum* (I am doing), *yapıyorsun* (you are doing). After *-yor*, the endings always have u.",
    "see": "gp-present-continuous"
  },
